>
> `LAST_NAME | FIRST_NAME | RANK | BRANCH | HULL_ID | COMM_DATE | F2F_FLAG | DURATION_DAYS | DEST_STRING`
>
> *(Header reconstruction **Debated**; structure **Invented** for clarity; McKinnon consistently described Excel ship/officer lists.)*

---

He copied the workbook to three disks because redundancy was the only religion he trusted.

He did not tell Janis.

He told her the next morning that he felt ill, and she touched his forehead and said he was burning up, and he was, but not from fever.

From the integer **4680** sitting behind his eyes like a afterimage.
